  "body": "@Constellation implemented external import maps in WebKit as per https://wicg.github.io/import-maps/. They're not included in #8075, but still seem worth standardizing.\r\n\r\ncc @domenic @hiroshige-g @allstarschh \r\n\r\nIssues we need to triage as part of this:\r\n\r\n- [ ] https://github.com/WICG/import-maps/issues/163 + https://github.com/WICG/import-maps/issues/282 (tl;dr: register MIME type with IANA)\r\n- [ ] https://github.com/WICG/import-maps/issues/235 (although this just seems like a Chrome bug report maybe?)",
